ng-[1.7]\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong>Share your unique link or discount code via social content, ring design videos, engagement/wedding content, gift guides, or blog roundups. We provide high-res product images and pre-written captions.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Other information:</strong>No minimum follower count — we prioritize content quality and audience fit. DM @omour_otj or email us for custom assets, co-branded landing pages, or collaboration ideas.</p></div></div></div></div></div><br></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-start\"><div class=\"text-text-300\"><div class=\"text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between\"><div class=\"w-fit\"><div class=\"relative text-text-500 group-hover/btn:text-text-100\"></div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
